An incident

The teams are `SRE` and `Product`. `Pager` and `Status page` are owned by
`SRE`. `Support desk` is owned by `Product`. Use the key `owner`. Write the
story `incident`: the `Pager` alerts the `Status page`, and the `Status page`
informs the `Support desk`. Show it as lanes.
---
Pager, Status page { owner: SRE }
Support desk { owner: Product }
story incident {
  Pager -> Status page: alert
  Status page -> Support desk: inform
}
show lanes of incident
